/*⁣‍‌‌⁠‍‍⁠​​‌⁠​‌​​⁠⁠⁠‍‍⁠​​⁠⁠⁠​‍‌‌⁠⁠‍‌‌​‍⁠⁠​⁠‌⁠​‍⁠‌⁠‌‌​‍​‌‌‍‌⁠​‌‍‍‌​⁣ 抑痛吟 by点星 禁止二传， 气泡禁止二改，界面的图片和文案可二改更换自用 */

:root {
  --chat-header-height: 100px;
  --chat-header-avatar-size: 34px;
  /* 顶栏透明 + 去边框 + 去毛玻璃 */
  --chat-header-bg: transparent;
  --chat-header-blur: 0px;
  --chat-header-border: transparent;
}

.chat-header-custom,
.chat-header-custom .glass-header {
  position: relative !important;
  /* 兜底：强制透明、去边框、去阴影 */
  background: transparent !important;
  border: none !important;
  border-bottom: none !important;
  box-shadow: none !important;
  backdrop-filter: none !important;
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: none !important;
}

/* 左侧图标（稍缩小 + 左移 + 横向拉长），不挡点击 */
.chat-header-custom::before {
  content: "" !important;
  position: absolute !important;
  left: 72px !important;              /* 96px → 72px，往左挪 */
  top: 50% !important;                /* 垂直居中 */
  transform: translateY(-50%) !important;
  width: 148px !important;            /* 横向拉长：比高度宽 */
  height: 118px !important;           /* 132px → 118px，稍微缩小 */
  background-image: url("https://imgbed.heliar.top/i/aQ5oA289C6IXSw3Z_Camera_XHS_1792380952280spectrum_1040g34o31t9lbdkf5a1g5n8qo2l5m583qie57b0_edit_489735775342814.jpg") !important;
  background-size: contain !important;   /* 保持比例，图片会按比例缩进框内 */
  background-repeat: no-repeat !important;
  background-position: center !important;
  pointer-events: none !important;
  z-index: 4 !important;
}

/* 左一返回键位置的图标（放大 + 往上 + 左移），不挡返回键点击 */
.chat-header-custom::after {
  content: "" !important;
  position: absolute !important;
  left: -8px !important;              /* -16px → -8px，往右挪回一点 */
  top: 8px !important;                /* 往上贴，可继续调 */
  transform: none !important;
  width: 84px !important;             /* 保持 84px */
  height: 84px !important;
  background-image: url("https://imgbed.heliar.top/i/Axfo6jx619BeDvUy_retouch_2026101911503151.png") !important;
  background-size: contain !important;
  background-repeat: no-repeat !important;
  background-position: center !important;
  pointer-events: none !important;    /* 点击穿透到返回键 */
  z-index: 4 !important;
}

/* 头像 */
.chat-header-custom .header-avatar-container {
  position: absolute !important;
  top: 9px !important; /* 数字越小越往上 */
  right: 12px !important;
  transform: none !important;
  margin: 0 !important;
  z-index: 5 !important;
  pointer-events: none !important;
}

.chat-header-custom .header-avatar-container *,
.chat-header-custom .chat-header-avatar {
  pointer-events: none !important;
}

/* 角色标题/备注 —— 前面固定加 @，随备注字数自适应向前延伸 */
.chat-header-custom .chat-header-title {
  position: absolute !important;
  top: 43px !important; /* 数字越小，越往上 */
  right: 12px !important;
  left: auto !important;
  transform: none !important;
  margin: 0 !important;
  text-align: right !important;
  max-width: 60% !important;
  z-index: 6 !important;
  pointer-events: none !important;
  /* 黑色下划线 */
  border-bottom: 1px solid #000 !important;
  padding-bottom: 2px !important;
}

/* 固定 @ 前缀，随标题内容宽度自适应 */
.chat-header-custom .chat-header-title::before {
  content: "@" !important;
  margin-right: 1px !important;
}

/* 角色标题下方的一行文案，黑色下划线 */
.chat-header-custom .chat-header-title::after {
  content: "我叹缘分浅浅如雨渐渐" !important;
  display: block !important;
  position: absolute !important;
  top: 100% !important;
  right: 0 !important;
  white-space: nowrap !important;
  font-size: 0.75em !important;
  font-weight: 400 !important;
  color: inherit !important;
  border-bottom: 1px solid #000 !important;
  padding-bottom: 2px !important;
  margin-top: 2px !important;
}

/* 隐藏四个原生按键图标，但保留按钮点击区域与功能 */
.chat-header-custom .header-btn-back svg,
.chat-header-custom .header-btn-info svg,
.chat-header-custom .header-btn-phone svg,
.chat-header-custom .header-btn-video svg {
  visibility: hidden !important;      /* 图标不可见，但按钮仍占位可点 */
}

/* 若图标不是 svg 而是 i/img 等，一并隐藏 */
.chat-header-custom .header-btn-back i,
.chat-header-custom .header-btn-info i,
.chat-header-custom .header-btn-phone i,
.chat-header-custom .header-btn-video i,
.chat-header-custom .header-btn-back img,
.chat-header-custom .header-btn-info img,
.chat-header-custom .header-btn-phone img,
.chat-header-custom .header-btn-video img {
  visibility: hidden !important;
}

/* 设置键等按钮保持可点 */
.chat-header-custom .header-btn-info,
.chat-header-custom .header-action-btn {
  position: relative !important;
  z-index: 10 !important;
  pointer-events: auto !important;
}

/* ===== 底栏透明 ===== */
