/*⁣‍‌‌⁠‍‍⁠​​‌⁠​‌​​⁠⁠⁠‍‍⁠​​⁠⁠⁠​‍‌‌⁠⁠‍‌‌​‍⁠⁠​⁠‌⁠​‍⁠‌⁠‌‌​‍​‌‌‍‌⁠​‌‍‍‌​⁣ 🌟 背景层：填满整个组件底层 */
.bg-layer {
  position: absolute; 
  inset: 0; 
  z-index: 0;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
}
.bg-layer.is-glass {
  backdrop-filter: blur(24px) saturate(180%);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(24px) saturate(180%);
}

.content-layer {
  position: absolute; 
  inset: 0; 
  z-index: 1;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  justify-content: space-between;
  padding: 8%;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
}

.header-row {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: flex-end;
  gap: 6px;
  height: 15%;
}

.css-calendar-icon {
  width: 13px;
  height: 13px;
  border: 1px solid var(--icon-color);
  border-radius: 2px;
  position: relative;
  background-color: transparent;
  flex-shrink: 0;
  margin-top: 1px; 
  background-image: linear-gradient(var(--icon-color), var(--icon-color));
  background-size: 100% 1px;
  background-position: 0 2px;
  background-repeat: no-repeat;
}

.css-calendar-icon::before {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  top: -2px;
  left: 3px;
  width: 1px;
  height: 3px;
  background-color: var(--icon-color);
  box-shadow: 4px 0 0 var(--icon-color);
}

.css-calendar-icon::after {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  top: 5px;
  left: 2px;
  width: 1px;
  height: 1px;
  background-color: var(--icon-color);
  border-radius: 50%;
  box-shadow: 
    3px 0 0 var(--icon-color),
    6px 0 0 var(--icon-color),
    0 3px 0 var(--icon-color),
    3px 3px 0 var(--icon-color),
    6px 3px 0 var(--icon-color);
}

.day-text {
  font-size: clamp(10px, 4cqw, 14px);
  font-weight: 500;
  color: var(--sub-text-color);
  letter-spacing: 0.5px;
}

.quote-row {
